{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_title", "source_sha256": "07e62821aa0336419d8ba32fbe8c93d77d6ee071f008e233fb93bd254b4434e3", "ja": "育とおでかけ2", "zh": "和育一起出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d3e433593bc1f687ca1d6a7408081d5f4855d3ccab95a0d3ba04fd5f08f53e3a", "ja": "育とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和育一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "82dfdad2f8bae513a539fbc57aae4ea817fce476a403b7e8930280a834225d69", "ja": "（仕事帰り、育のリクエストで港の夜景を見に来た。\nなんでも、ネットで写真を見たんだそうだが……）", "zh": "（下班后，应育的要求来看港口的夜景。据说她是在网上看到照片的，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "580a26d6e99f7067f8c28561e3b22f5d92c38405ad99a7303371648f81a2208a", "ja": "わあー！　写真で見たのとおんなじ！\nキラキラしてて、すっごくきれいだね♪", "zh": "哇——！跟照片上看到的一模一样！\n闪闪发亮的，真的好漂亮呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "549355cc1191771a3fdea05c9eba37eae017103034a45c32323fccf9fb9d24a7", "ja": "ところで、{$P$}さん。\nどうして大人の人は、デートで夜景を見に来るの？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生。为什么大人会在约会时来看夜景呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ddb883d434cbac97db83b4c8f796781026604513c90158cd49b43e87287511bf", "ja": "え！？　そ、それはだな、えーっと……\nわからないな！", "zh": "诶！？这、这个嘛，呃……  \n我也不知道啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "e13af846201cc41de8e1cc6b75fbd8b63c73d9f7bd741e8598f8e978a4eef29c", "ja": "大人なのにわからないんだ。でも、わからないことは、\n知ったかぶりしないほうがいいんだよね？", "zh": "明明是个大人却不知道啊。不过，不知道的事情，\n还是不要不懂装懂比较好对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f30f73d87bc159b3b11151b8f18c69d90c803d3553a986abeb76f0eab33ad6f1", "ja": "鋭いな、育……。まあ、理由はわからなくても、\n綺麗なものは綺麗だしな。", "zh": "真敏锐啊，育……不过，就算不知道理由，漂亮的东西就是漂亮的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "77f4433cb51775035fdb1f8e9bce4f2e4f675168627513e348eeab4be3450fd3", "ja": "うん！　夜景って、なんだか\nライブの時に見る景色に似てるね。", "zh": "嗯！夜景总觉得和演唱会时看到的景色很像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "d9cf97f84407a5702a0108707abcb0e9d36edf71a135b7ea7b85b0a00c185d24", "ja": "はぁ～、ロマンチックだな～。\nわたしもいつか、大人になったら……えへへ♪", "zh": "哈啊～真浪漫啊～。\n我以后要是也能长大成人……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "44246686b5900b9d8a534ba1ddde01ad427832c23973d9b2a9b8cb81a8642ab5", "ja": "（育は1日でも早く、大人になりたいんだろうな。\n将来、どんなアイドルになっているのか……楽しみだ）", "zh": "（育大概恨不得能早1天成为大人吧。将来，她会成为怎样的偶像呢……真让人期待。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
